rience. Mine asteroids, unlock and upgrade weapons, battle rival mining ships, weave through escalating enemy fire, take down sector bosses, and build branching, run-defining upgrades as threats continue to intensify.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asteroid Buster Mode.</strong> Smash apart asteroid fields with precision cursor mining while your numbers climb fast, upgrades stack, and small gains compound into serious mining power.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode.</strong> No timer. Stay alive, gather fuel, and decide when you're ready to jump to the next star system.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Deeper Into the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308550/extras/edd28fc47dabc67284b28cd3a0c417c6.poster.avif?t=1784288616\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308550/extras/edd28fc47dabc67284b28cd3a0c417c6.webm?t=1784288616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308550/extras/edd28fc47dabc67284b28cd3a0c417c6.mp4?t=1784288616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching star systems filled with opportunities and danger. Choose your path, discover valuable resources, unlock powerful improvements, and push further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is part of the process. Every run feeds your permanent upgrade tree, so even a lost ship isn't a lost run. Chase better upgrades, discover stronger combinations, and see how far your next attempt can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308550/extras/a32b53a2d42bc4220640dd8a62643ffe.webp?t=1784288616\" width=1560 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mine or Burn is in development. All screenshots and footage represent alpha gameplay. Visuals, mechanics, and systems are subject to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and follow Mine or Burn</strong> to receive development updates, feature reveals, and progress toward release.</p>", "short_description": "Start with a basic mining ship and snowball into an asteroid-crushing powerhouse in this incremental bullet hell roguelite. Mine asteroids, battle rival miners, stack upgrades, create powerful builds, and survive escalating threats across dangerous star systems.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308550/8188cada91d0f79f205db3706a664545d92dc89c/header.jpg?t=1784288616", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308550/120d338955ffbcb3ae8332ab9eca8190041318a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784288616", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308550/120d338955ffbcb3ae8332ab9eca8190041318a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784288616", "website": "https://www.mineorburn.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6700 / Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bi